<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Beachboyz Detailing | Miami Mobile Auto Detailing</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Beachboyz Detailing — premium mobile auto detailing in Miami. Exotic cars, classics, trucks, SUVs, fleets and RVs.">
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f4efe6;
      color: #17202a;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      min-height: 90vh;
      padding: 30px 7%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 35, .45), rgba(10, 25, 35, .65)),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #0e7180, #f0a35b);
      color: white;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .nav-button {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.8);
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 30px;
    }

    .hero {
      max-width: 850px;
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 92px);
      line-height: .95;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: white;
      color: #17202a;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 75px 7%;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .intro h2,
    .services h2 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .packages {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .price {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .experience {
      background: #173642;
      color: white;
    }

    .experience-content {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .experience h2 {
      font-size: 45px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .experience ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }

    .experience li {
      margin: 10px 0;
    }

    .cta {
      text-align: center;
      background: #e7b36c;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #101b20;
      color: white;
      padding: 35px 7%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header {
        min-height: 95vh;
      }

      nav {
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .button {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">BEACHBOYZ</div>
      <a class="nav-button" href="#booking">Book Now</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Miami Mobile Detailing</div>
      <h1>The Miami Experience.</h1>
      <p>
        We don't just provide a detail. We provide the experience.
        From exotic cars and classics to trucks, SUVs, fleets and RVs,
        every detail gets the Beachboyz treatment.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="#packages">View Services</a>
      <a class="button" href="#booking">Book Your Detail</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section>
    <div class="intro">
      <h2>More Than A Wash.</h2>
      <p>
        We specialize in every detail, whether it's a modern exotic or a
        timeless classic. Our goal is simple: go above and beyond and
        leave your vehicle looking like it belongs back in the showroom.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services" id="packages">
    <h2>Beachboyz Services</h2>

    <div class="packages">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Beach Wash</h3>
        <p>Premium exterior maintenance detail for keeping your ride fresh.</p>
        <div class="price">$150</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Sunset Detail</h3>
        <p>Deep exterior detail with clay treatment and sealant protection.</p>
        <div class="price">$200</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Miami Experience</h3>
        <p>
          Our premium showroom-style detail with enhanced protection,
          engine bay service and attention to every detail.
        </p>
        <div class="price">Premium</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="experience">
    <div class="experience-content">
      <h2>The Miami Experience</h2>
      <p>
        Built for customers who want more than a clean car.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>✓ Showroom finish</li>
        <li>✓ Engine bay detail</li>
        <li>✓ Premium sealant protection</li>
        <li>✓ Enhanced water beading protection</li>
        <li>✓ Windshield protection</li>
        <li>✓ Exotic wheel protection</li>
        <li>✓ Seat shampoo included</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Every vehicle is treated with care, using professional techniques
        and fresh microfiber towels throughout the process.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="booking" class="cta">
    <h2>Ready For The Miami Experience?</h2>
    <p>Book your Beachboyz detail and let us take care of the rest.</p>
    <br>
    <a class="button" href="tel:+1">Call Beachboyz</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <strong>BEACHBOYZ DETAILING</strong>
    <p>Miami • Mobile Auto Detailing</p>
    <p>Exotics • Classics • Trucks • SUVs • Fleets • RVs</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
